{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>The English text in this game is machine translated.</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">No Choices, No Branches, No Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All you can do is choose places to visit and progress through a fantasy story that concludes in about a 3 hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Earn Your Secret Stash Through Daily Work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You tackle your job as a mechanic through a &quot;Gear Maze Minigame.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the secret stash earned from work to unlock helper features for solving complex mazes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short duration (2-3 hours)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Currency and minigame system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro pixel art</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The setting is the &quot;Defensive Nation Melkid,&quot; embroiled in an ongoing war with mysterious monsters known as &quot;Mamono.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Having lost her mother at a young age, Eshina lives her life as a mechanic alongside her imaginary friend, Jeena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, Eshina's chance encounter with the prisoner Teresha leads her into the dark underbelly of the nation...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short novel that blends a commoner's story of &quot;working and living as a mechanic&quot; with elements of war and science fiction.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Watched Ending.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2793220/5fd1eccf5248cf9ad4b07397d22e6469968a928b.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2793220?t=1729690902","b